<fw type="sig" place="bottom">F f 2</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Man</fw><lb/>
<pb n="452" facs="#f0460"/>
<p>Man &#x017F;agt: mein Ro&#x0364;schen! Niemand<lb/>
