<p>Liebes Kind!</p><lb/>
<p>Liebe Mutter!</p><lb/>
<p>einzige Tochter!</p><lb/>
<p>einzige Mutter! &#x2014;</p><lb/>
<p>Das war alles, was verhandelt ward.<lb/>
